  "details": "whenever i use a asset like a flash light or a spotlight attached to my avi it breaks entirely regardless of world. be it a basic local flashlight, Pointless's advanced flashlight or the vrc lighting booth asset.\n\nIve tested this in worlds like Victory Mine and Shadow Factory.\n\nvictory mines own internal flashlight system breaks as well.\n\nShadow factory a dynamic light heavy world works but my own assets still fail.\n\ntl;dr\n\nsymptoms of the bug: Some world and all avatar light assets do not properly illuminate a area instead illuminating entire mesh's of either all visible avatars or on all surfaces near.",
